<article class="recipe-detail"><div class="container recipe-back"><a class="text-link" href="/blogs/recipes">← Back to recipes</a></div><header class="container recipe-detail-hero"><div class="recipe-detail-copy"><div class="recipe-card-tags"><span>Summer</span><span>Healthy</span><span>Quick</span></div><h1>Masala Chaas (Spiced Buttermilk)</h1><p>Refreshing summer cooler with yogurt and aromatic spice blends.</p><div class="recipe-facts"><span>Prep: 5 min</span><span>Cook: 0 min</span><span>2 servings</span><span>Easy</span></div><div class="recipe-actions"><a class="button" href="#recipe-method">Let’s get cooking</a><button type="button" class="text-link" data-print-recipe>Print recipe</button></div></div><div class="recipe-detail-photo"><span class="recipe-drawn-photo"><img src="{{ 'buttermilk-glass.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Illustration of a glass of spiced buttermilk" loading="lazy"></span></div></header><div class="container recipe-cook-layout" id="recipe-method"><aside class="recipe-ingredients"><span class="eyebrow">A little preparation</span><h2>Ingredients</h2><p class="recipe-check-hint">Tick as you go.</p><ul><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>1 cup fresh yogurt</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>2 cups cold water</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>½ tsp Roasted Cumin Powder</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>A pinch of black salt</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Fresh mint leaves</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>1 green chilli (optional)</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Salt to taste</span></label></li></ul></aside><section class="recipe-method"><span class="eyebrow">One step at a time</span><h2>Let’s make it.</h2><ol><li><p>Whisk yogurt and water until smooth.</p></li><li><p>Add cumin powder, black salt, regular salt.</p></li><li><p>Chop mint and chilli, stir in.</p></li><li><p>Pour over ice cubes.</p></li><li><p>Garnish with mint sprig and cumin.</p></li></ol><aside class="recipe-tips"><span class="art-wash" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'spice-sprig.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></span><div><h3>A little kitchen wisdom</h3><ul><li>Blend for smoother texture.</li><li>Add grated ginger for extra kick.</li><li>Aids digestion after heavy meals.</li></ul></div></aside></section></div><section class="container recipe-related"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What shall we make next?</h2><a class="text-link" href="/blogs/recipes">All recipes</a></div><div class="recipe-card-grid"><article class="recipe-card" data-recipe-tags="Quick Meals"><a class="recipe-card-photo" href="https://www.ammammas.in/recipes/mango-pickle-rice"><img src="{{ 'ref-9af26b3e272f.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Mango Pickle Rice (Avakaya Annam)" loading="lazy"></a><div class="recipe-card-copy"><div class="recipe-card-tags"><span>Quick Meals</span><span>Easy</span></div><h2><a href="https://www.ammammas.in/recipes/mango-pickle-rice">Mango Pickle Rice (Avakaya Annam)</a></h2><p>A beloved Andhra comfort food — steaming hot rice mixed with tangy mango pickle.</p><div class="recipe-card-meta"><span>Prep 5 min</span><span>Cook 0 min</span><span>2 servings</span></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.ammammas.in/recipes/mango-pickle-rice">Let’s make it <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="recipe-card" data-recipe-tags="Street Food"><a class="recipe-card-photo" href="/blogs/recipes/parota-egg-kothu"><img src="{{ 'ref-7e57e32b1b50.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Egg Kothu Parota" loading="lazy"></a><div class="recipe-card-copy"><div class="recipe-card-tags"><span>Street Food</span><span>Easy</span></div><h2><a href="/blogs/recipes/parota-egg-kothu">Egg Kothu Parota</a></h2><p>Popular street-food — soft parotas torn and tossed with spiced scrambled eggs.</p><div class="recipe-card-meta"><span>Prep 10 min</span><span>Cook 10 min</span><span>2 servings</span></div><a class="text-